<title>USA: IPO FILING - ErgoBilt Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - ErgoBilt Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    ErgoBilt Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			ERGB.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $8-$10/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    5,023,334</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs Business: Dallas, Tx-based developer, manufacturer and marketer of customized, high-end ergonomic office furniture. Use of Proceeds: Company intends to pay $8.75 million of the net to the BodyBilt shareholders representing the cash portion of the merger consideration, to repay indebtedness and for working capital, capital expenditures, possible future acquitisions and other general corporate purposes. Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Sales		   $13,672	    $9,189</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $1,794	    $1,060</p>
